WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:05.990
Curious about the impact SCP-914 might have
on his phone, and concerned about the possibility

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:11.080
of it exploding in his pocket, Dr. Sutherland
decided to try out the Clockworks on his Samsung

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:12.500
Galaxy Note 7.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.840
He placed it in the machinery on the setting
“1:1.”

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:21.210
The output was a single M67 fragmentation
grenade with no anomalous properties.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:26.669
Clearly, SCP-914 has a sense of humor, and
is able to somehow keep up with a knowledge

00:00:26.669 --> 00:00:28.159
of current events.

